      "name": "Droning Flyby",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The drone of the derakni's wings mesmerizes listeners. The derakni Flies. All creatures within 20 feet of the derakni at any point during this movement must attempt a DC 23 Will Saving Throw saving throw. On a failure, the target is Confused for 1 round (3 rounds on a critical failure); on a success, the target is immune for 1 minute.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
